# RIT calibration cohort (P1a): 130 teacher episodes on the EVAL segment.
#
# Topology: 5 GR00T servers on weilandserver behind the public 1:1 range,
# 1:1 with 5 sim workers on timan107 (the HDF5 collector is single-connection).
# pi0.5 endpoints are declared for the P2 half of the run and are unused while
# the GR00T lane is up: the two teachers never share the 48 GiB card.
